l freeze.\nthis is a log from a rooted devices\n\n[godot.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19123121/godot.log)\n\nI have a Android 13 devices with vulkan\nIt also can reproduces the issue,but i cant export its log\nit also can reproduces on x86_64 Android\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_crash_2025-03-07_16-37-30.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19123153/test_crash_2025-03-07_16-37-30.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103753/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103753/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}